      "PATSY: Listen, I'm doin’ a benefit over in Kansas City this weekend but when I get back, we'll go do some shoppin' for the baby -- okay?\nLORETTA: Thanks, Patsy. For everything. She starts to get into the car.\nPATSY: Hey -- ain't you gonna hug me goodbye? Loretta puts the box down and embraces Patsy.\nLORETTA: You're the only friend I got, Patsy.",
